id=a52sxq_hidl
name=Galaxy A52s 5G HIDL framework support
author=kusti420
description=Restores hwservicemanager, the hidl allocator/memory implementations and their framework VINTF entries (missing from the HIDL-less Fold8 system this was written for; the S26 Ultra source has a system_ext hwservicemanager again, which is replaced by the same AOSP CP2A build) for the HIDL-based A52s vendor.
